{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128162221560-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261128162221\"/><p>就業及退休金事務部部分網上服務暫停。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>英國就業及退休金事務部周五（27日）指，由於發現影響系統的網絡事件，部門中斷部分線上服務，正與國家網絡安全中心及政府網絡協調中心密切合作展開調查，努力盡快恢復相關線上服務。英媒報道，受事件影響，數百萬人無法登入相關系統申請福利。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:35:56.445636+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:22:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:33.012955+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:29:32.744710+00:00","content_hash":"b523dd40c3370ae303c995efdb8a83aba1b04b677e7abc875fbee45856e1310b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}